      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of those memories is crushing, and it's natural to feel like you're an intruder in your own life. But you are not a placeholder; you are a living, breathing person with your own unique worth, separate from anyone else's story. Even when the past feels like a theft, your present existence is valid and deserves to be honored. Please consider talking to someone who can help you navigate these incredibly painful feelings.",
      "source": "target",
